<title>ITALY: Milan bourse hitch fixed but trade not yet resumed.</title>
<headline>Milan bourse hitch fixed but trade not yet resumed.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>A technical software problem which halted screen-based trading on the Milan stock exchange has been resolved but it is not yet known when trading will resume, a spokesman for the bourse authority said.</p>
<p>Further details will be issued as soon as possible.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392 6129589</p>
</text>
